**档位与文献核对**。第一档(新近小猜想)。核对对象为 OEIS 条目正文,已逐字读取 `https://oeis.org/search?q=id:A051451&fmt=text`、`https://oeis.org/search?q=id:A001013&fmt=text`、`https://oeis.org/search?q=id:A129912&fmt=text`。定义(`%N`,逐字):

> A051451: `a(n) = lcm{ 1,2,...,x } where x is the n-th prime power (A000961).`
> A001013: `Jordan-Polya numbers: products of factorial numbers A000142.`
> A129912: `Numbers that are products of distinct primorial numbers (see A002110).`

猜想(A051451 的 `%C`,Bill McEachen,2023-04-28,逐字):

> `Conjecture: Every term = A001013(j)*A129912(k) for some j,k.`

即:每个前缀最小公倍数 \(L(X)=\operatorname{lcm}(1,\dots,X)\)(\(X\) 取素数幂)都能写成 \(J\cdot P\),其中 \(J\) 是若干阶乘之积(可重复),\(P\) 是若干**互异**素数阶乘(primorial)之积。该断言在文献中没有证明,也没有反例被记录。

